(text "2/4  LM5176 4-switch buck-boost charger  (VIN_P 22-26 V -> NODE 0-26.2 V, ~100 W)" (at 15 15 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid 8b13d2fb-0547-4390-8f60-cc5385fa6086))
(text "NODE = chassis output and capacitor bank (via CM01).  fsw ~248 kHz (RT 33k), Vout 26.3 V (1.5M/47k), UVLO ~19.3 V (220k/15k), CCM, hiccup disabled (MODE 200k)." (at 15 20.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 5eead11c-d2a0-4e25-b803-b534be8ac879))
(text "Power FETs: 60 V class (input TVS SMBJ30A clamps up to ~48 V).  Gate nets HG1/LG1/HG2/LG2 and SW1/SW2 are local labels; keep gate loops short in layout." (at 15 23.5 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 6ecef96a-cf3f-48db-bd33-93cda80d2e29))
