(text "Current limits over Rcs 12 mR (min/typ/max):\n buck valley 66/80/94 mV = 5.5/6.7/7.9 A, boost peak 100/120/140 mV = 8.3/10/11.8 A\nWorst L peak ~12.5 A (valley max + ripple, L -20% tol, -14% at 12 A) < Isat 17 A\nCSLOPE = L x 2 uS / (Rcs x 5) = 333 pF at 10 uH. 220 pF C0G gives\n 1.0-1.9x dead-beat slope over L = 6.9-12 uH (datasheet: stable above 0.5x)" (at 198 150 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 111ea3b9-9714-4f09-9280-ac469c7c5e41))
